1
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,241
You can turn your head a little bit.

2
00:00:18,321 --> 00:00:19,640
Can't you move a little?

3
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,081
You just stand here and don't move.

4
00:00:22,081 --> 00:00:23,600
Haven't I moved enough?

5
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:32,720
It's a chance encounter.

6
00:00:34,041 --> 00:00:35,840
What a coincidence.

7
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:38,800
Big star.

8
00:00:42,201 --> 00:00:44,680
You thought no one would recognize you
in a small town.

9
00:00:49,041 --> 00:00:51,481
I should have gone to Nanlu
with your family for New Year.

10
00:00:55,121 --> 00:00:57,281
I don't want to, and you don't want to either.

11
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,041
I don't want to be a star.

12
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:35,041
You want to hear me say.

13
00:01:35,121 --> 00:01:36,121
No.

14
00:01:45,521 --> 00:01:47,000
I thought you would understand me.

15
00:01:47,041 --> 00:01:48,441
So I didn't say much.

16
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,241
Going to Hunter School,

17
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:00,401
You didn't need to talk much anyway.

18
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,840
Anyway,

19
00:02:06,201 --> 00:02:07,600
you can't escape from here.

20
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,680
What are you doing?
